\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{2}{Extraction network architecture. The magnitude spectrogram is encoded by eight 2D convolutional layers, conditioned on the speaker embedding via concatenation, and processed by a BiLSTM to predict a soft mask $\mathbf {M} \in [0,1]^{F \times T}$. Dashed box denotes a frozen pretrained model}{figure.1}{}}
